//! `airconv_public.h`'s `SM50*` functions, constants and `#[repr(C)]` mirrors for the front ends.
//!
//! On Windows the `SM50*` entry points resolve against `winemetal.dll`'s forwarding thunks
//! (`extern "C"`); natively on macOS they resolve against `winemetal.dylib`'s linked `airconv`
//! (`extern "C-unwind"`). Every `sm50_ptr64_t` handle (`sm50_shader_t`, `sm50_bitcode_t`,
//! `sm50_error_t`, and [`Sm50CompiledBitcode::data`]) is a `u64` across all five targets so 32-bit
//! `i686` and 64-bit targets share the wire and host layout. `abi.rs`, generated by
//! `tools/winemetal-layouts.sh --seam-abi src/winemetal/sys/sm50-abi.h winemetal_sys::sm50`,
//! asserts each function's signature against clang's AST on all five targets.

use core::{
    ffi::{c_char, c_void},
    mem::offset_of,
};

mod abi;

